# Story 64: Approval Panes (40s)
# Hook: Route every approval request to one dedicated pane and triage them in one place.
# Duration: 40s
# Source: story-064-approval-panes.tape
#
# Voiceover script with timing cues.
# Format: [START --> END] narration text
# Each entry should be spoken within its time window.
# Gaps between entries are silent (viewer watches the demo).
#
# Total segments: 6

[00:00.0 --> 00:03.0]
Route every approval request to one dedicated pane and triage them in one place.

[00:03.0 --> 00:08.0]
Start rysh, then split a second pane that will collect approvals from across your workspace.

[00:08.0 --> 00:18.0]
Switch to rysh mode and register this pane as the approval pane. Now tool requests from other panes land right here.

[00:18.0 --> 00:30.0]
List pending approvals, clear the queue, and enable an attention indicator so you never miss a waiting action.

[00:30.0 --> 00:37.0]
A quick clear empties the queue when you're caught up.

[00:37.0 --> 00:40.0]
One pane, every decision, no context switching.

